===Etymology===
{{PIE word|en|pénkʷe}}
From {{inh|en|enm|fiftene}}, from {{inh|en|ang|fīftīene}}, {{m|ang|fīftēne}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*fimftehun}}. Cognate with {{cog|fy|fyftjin}}, {{cog|nl|vijftien}}, {{cog|de|fünfzehn}}, {{cog|da|femten}}. Equivalent to {{suffix|en|five|teen}}.

